IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gdpr-core`
IMPORT `gdpr-core-2`
IMPORT `gdpr-definitions-2`
IMPORT `K2-art-1`
IMPORT `K2-art-2b`
IMPORT `K2-art-3`

-- ============================================================================
-- K2-seat-controller.l4 -- THE SEAT LAYER OF K2 FOR A CONTROLLER, the body that determines the purposes and means of the processing.
-- Written by K2 (Sonnet 5.5); produced from the layer-1 signatures by notes/gen-seats.py.
-- SEAT: A CONTROLLER, the body that determines the purposes and means of the processing.  Every question is phrased as that person asks it and takes plain inputs: a yes or
-- no, a choice from a list, or yes, no or not sure where a combining rule takes a MAYBE (not sure is
-- treated as not covered).  Nothing here is new law, and no rule is restated: every answer is a call on a
-- layer-1 rule of gdpr-definitions-2.l4, K2-art-1.l4, K2-art-2b.l4 or K2-art-3.l4.
-- Questions are grouped under § headings in the Regulation's order.
-- HOW TO READ A RESULT.  JUST TRUE and JUST FALSE are answers the Regulation gives in its own words; NOTHING
-- means it does not answer on these facts (NOTES: Reading a result).  Never read NOTHING as no.
-- THERE IS NO SEAT FOR AN AUTHORITY.  Provisions that address only an authority or the lawmaker (Art 2(3)
-- second sentence, Art 4(24) for the objection's author) are encoded in layer 1 and reach this seat only through
-- the questions below, for what they mean to the person.
-- ============================================================================

-- Yes, no or not sure, for a fact that a combining rule takes as a MAYBE.
DECLARE `K2 controller answer` IS ONE OF
    `K2 controller answer: yes`
    `K2 controller answer: no`
    `K2 controller answer: not sure`

GIVEN answer IS A `K2 controller answer`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`K2 controller answer as a yes or no` MEANS
    CONSIDER answer
    WHEN `K2 controller answer: yes` THEN JUST TRUE -- input mapping
    WHEN `K2 controller answer: no` THEN JUST FALSE -- input mapping
    WHEN `K2 controller answer: not sure` THEN NOTHING -- input mapping

§ `Regulation (EU) 2016/679, Chapter I -- my questions as a controller`


§§ `Article 1`

-- 1(3): Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred
@export Under Article 1(3), as a controller, is a restriction or prohibition of the free movement of the personal data I process within the Union barred when its reason is the protection of natural persons?
GIVEN `the personal data move within the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data move within the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the measure restricts or prohibits that movement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the measure restricts or prohibits that movement? Answer true or false.
      `the reason for the measure is connected with the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the reason for the measure is connected with the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 1(3), as a controller, is a restriction or prohibition of the free movement of the personal data I process within the Union barred when its reason is the protection of natural persons` IS
    `Art 1(3) the restriction or prohibition of the free movement of personal data within the Union for reasons connected with data protection is barred` `the personal data move within the Union` `the measure restricts or prohibits that movement` `the reason for the measure is connected with the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data`


§§ `Article 2(3) and (4)`

-- 2(3)a: Art 2(3) Regulation (EC) No 45/2001 applies to the processing, where it is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies
@export Under Article 2(3), as a controller, does Regulation (EC) No 45/2001 apply to my processing of personal data?
GIVEN `the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 2(3), as a controller, does Regulation (EC) No 45/2001 apply to my processing of personal data` IS
    `Art 2(3) Regulation (EC) No 45/2001 applies to the processing, where it is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies`

-- 2(3)b: Art 2(3) this Regulation applies to the processing, where it is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies
@export Under Article 2(3), as a controller, does this Regulation apply to my processing of personal data, where I am a Union institution, body, office or agency?
GIVEN `the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 2(3), as a controller, does this Regulation apply to my processing of personal data, where I am a Union institution, body, office or agency` IS
    `Art 2(3) this Regulation applies to the processing, where it is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies`

-- 2(4): Art 2(4) this Regulation is without prejudice to the application of Directive 2000/31/EC
@export Under Article 2(4), as a controller, is this Regulation without prejudice to the application of Directive 2000/31/EC?
GIVEN `the matter is the application of Directive 2000/31/EC` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the matter is the application of Directive 2000/31/EC? Answer true or false.
      `the matter is the liability rules of intermediary service providers in Articles 12 to 15 of that Directive` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the matter is the liability rules of intermediary service providers in Articles 12 to 15 of that Directive? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 2(4), as a controller, is this Regulation without prejudice to the application of Directive 2000/31/EC` IS
    `Art 2(4) this Regulation is without prejudice to the application of Directive 2000/31/EC` `the matter is the application of Directive 2000/31/EC` `the matter is the liability rules of intermediary service providers in Articles 12 to 15 of that Directive`


§§ `Article 3`

-- 3(1): Art 3(1) the territorial limb: the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union
@export Under Article 3(1), as a controller, is the establishment limb met for my processing of personal data?
GIVEN `the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the processing takes place in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing takes place in the Union? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 3(1), as a controller, is the establishment limb met for my processing of personal data` IS
    `Art 3(1) the territorial limb: the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union` `the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union` `the processing takes place in the Union`

-- 3(2): Art 3(2) the territorial limb: the processing is of data subjects in the Union by a controller or processor not established in the Union, and the activities are related to offering goods or services or to monitoring behaviour
@export Under Article 3(2), as a controller, is the limb of data subjects in the Union and a controller or processor not established there met for my processing of personal data?
GIVEN `the data subjects are in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data subjects are in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the controller or processor is not established in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller or processor is not established in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the processing activities are related to the offering of goods or services to those data subjects in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing activities are related to the offering of goods or services to those data subjects in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `a payment of the data subject is required` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that a payment of the data subject is required? Answer true or false.
      `the processing activities are related to the monitoring of the behaviour of those data subjects` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing activities are related to the monitoring of the behaviour of those data subjects? Answer true or false.
      `their behaviour takes place within the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that their behaviour takes place within the Union? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 3(2), as a controller, is the limb of data subjects in the Union and a controller or processor not established there met for my processing of personal data` IS
    `Art 3(2) the territorial limb: the processing is of data subjects in the Union by a controller or processor not established in the Union, and the activities are related to offering goods or services or to monitoring behaviour` `the data subjects are in the Union` `the controller or processor is not established in the Union` `the processing activities are related to the offering of goods or services to those data subjects in the Union` `a payment of the data subject is required` `the processing activities are related to the monitoring of the behaviour of those data subjects` `their behaviour takes place within the Union`

-- 3(3): Art 3(3) the territorial limb: the processing is by a controller not established in the Union, in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law
@export Under Article 3(3), as a controller, is the limb of a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law met for my processing of personal data?
GIVEN `the controller is not established in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller is not established in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 3(3), as a controller, is the limb of a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law met for my processing of personal data` IS
    `Art 3(3) the territorial limb: the processing is by a controller not established in the Union, in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law` `the controller is not established in the Union` `the processing is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law`

-- 3: Art 3 this Regulation applies to the processing of personal data
@export Under Article 3, as a controller, does this Regulation apply to my processing of personal data?
GIVEN `Art 2(1) and (2) the processing is within the material scope of this Regulation` IS A `K2 controller answer` @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is within the material scope of this Regulation (Art 2(1) and (2))? Answer K2 controller answer: yes, K2 controller answer: no or K2 controller answer: not sure (not sure is treated as not covered).
      `the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the processing takes place in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing takes place in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the data subjects are in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data subjects are in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the controller or processor is not established in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller or processor is not established in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the processing activities are related to the offering of goods or services to those data subjects in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing activities are related to the offering of goods or services to those data subjects in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `a payment of the data subject is required` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that a payment of the data subject is required? Answer true or false.
      `the processing activities are related to the monitoring of the behaviour of those data subjects` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing activities are related to the monitoring of the behaviour of those data subjects? Answer true or false.
      `their behaviour takes place within the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that their behaviour takes place within the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the controller is not established in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller is not established in the Union? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 3, as a controller, does this Regulation apply to my processing of personal data` IS
    `Art 3 this Regulation applies to the processing of personal data` (`K2 controller answer as a yes or no` `Art 2(1) and (2) the processing is within the material scope of this Regulation`) `the processing is by the Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the processing is in the context of the activities of an establishment of a controller or a processor in the Union` `the processing takes place in the Union` `the data subjects are in the Union` `the controller or processor is not established in the Union` `the processing activities are related to the offering of goods or services to those data subjects in the Union` `a payment of the data subject is required` `the processing activities are related to the monitoring of the behaviour of those data subjects` `their behaviour takes place within the Union` `the controller is not established in the Union` `the processing is in a place where Member State law applies by virtue of public international law`


§§ `Article 4`

-- 4lead: Art 4 lead-in the definitions of Article 4 apply to the term
@export Under Article 4, as a controller, do the definitions of Article 4 apply to a term I use?
GIVEN `the term is used for the purposes of this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the term is used for the purposes of this Regulation? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4, as a controller, do the definitions of Article 4 apply to a term I use` IS
    `Art 4 lead-in the definitions of Article 4 apply to the term` `the term is used for the purposes of this Regulation`

-- 4(3): Art 4(3) the act is a restriction of processing
@export Under Article 4(3), as a controller, is what I did to stored personal data a restriction of processing?
GIVEN `the personal data are stored` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are stored? Answer true or false.
      `the personal data are marked` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are marked? Answer true or false.
      `the aim of the marking is to limit the processing of the personal data in the future` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the aim of the marking is to limit the processing of the personal data in the future? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(3), as a controller, is what I did to stored personal data a restriction of processing` IS
    `Art 4(3) the act is a restriction of processing` `the personal data are stored` `the personal data are marked` `the aim of the marking is to limit the processing of the personal data in the future`

-- 4(4): Art 4(4) the processing is profiling
@export Under Article 4(4), as a controller, is my processing profiling?
GIVEN `the processing is processing of personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is processing of personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is automated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is automated? Answer true or false.
      `the personal data are used to evaluate personal aspects relating to a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are used to evaluate personal aspects relating to a natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the personal aspect that is evaluated` IS A `Art 4(4) personal aspect` @desc The personal aspect that is evaluated: choose exactly one of: Art 4(4) performance at work; Art 4(4) economic situation; Art 4(4) health; Art 4(4) personal preferences; Art 4(4) interests; Art 4(4) reliability; Art 4(4) behaviour; Art 4(4) location; Art 4(4) movements; Art 4(4) some other personal aspect.
      `the aspects relate to a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the aspects relate to a natural person? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(4), as a controller, is my processing profiling` IS
    `Art 4(4) the processing is profiling` `the processing is processing of personal data` `the processing is automated` (IF `the personal data are used to evaluate personal aspects relating to a natural person` THEN (LIST `the personal aspect that is evaluated`) ELSE EMPTY) `the aspects relate to a natural person`

-- 4(5): Art 4(5) the processing is pseudonymisation
@export Under Article 4(5), as a controller, is my processing pseudonymisation?
GIVEN `the processing is processing of personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is processing of personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the personal data can no longer be attributed to a specific data subject without the use of additional information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data can no longer be attributed to a specific data subject without the use of additional information? Answer true or false.
      `the additional information is kept separately` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the additional information is kept separately? Answer true or false.
      `the additional information is subject to technical and organisational measures to ensure that the personal data are not attributed to an identified or identifiable natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the additional information is subject to technical and organisational measures to ensure that the personal data are not attributed to an identified or identifiable natural person? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(5), as a controller, is my processing pseudonymisation` IS
    `Art 4(5) the processing is pseudonymisation` `the processing is processing of personal data` `the personal data can no longer be attributed to a specific data subject without the use of additional information` `the additional information is kept separately` `the additional information is subject to technical and organisational measures to ensure that the personal data are not attributed to an identified or identifiable natural person`

-- 4(9)a: Art 4(9) the body is a recipient
@export Under Article 4(9), as a controller, is the body I disclose personal data to a recipient?
GIVEN body IS A `Kind of person or body` @desc Body: choose exactly one of: natural person; legal person; public authority; agency; other body; not a person or body.
      `the personal data are disclosed to the body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are disclosed to the body? Answer true or false.
      `the body is a third party` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the body is a third party? Answer true or false.
      `the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry? Answer true or false.
      `the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(9), as a controller, is the body I disclose personal data to a recipient` IS
    `Art 4(9) the body is a recipient` body `the personal data are disclosed to the body` `the body is a third party` `the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry` `the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law`

-- 4(9)b: Art 4(9) the processing by the public authority of the data it receives in a particular inquiry is in compliance with the applicable data protection rules
@export Under Article 4(9), as a controller, is the processing by a public authority of the personal data it received from me in a particular inquiry in compliance with the applicable data protection rules?
GIVEN body IS A `Kind of person or body` @desc Body: choose exactly one of: natural person; legal person; public authority; agency; other body; not a person or body.
      `the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry? Answer true or false.
      `the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law? Answer true or false.
      `the processing complies with the applicable data protection rules according to the purposes of the processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing complies with the applicable data protection rules according to the purposes of the processing? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(9), as a controller, is the processing by a public authority of the personal data it received from me in a particular inquiry in compliance with the applicable data protection rules` IS
    `Art 4(9) the processing by the public authority of the data it receives in a particular inquiry is in compliance with the applicable data protection rules` body `the personal data are received in the framework of a particular inquiry` `the receipt is in accordance with Union or Member State law` `the processing complies with the applicable data protection rules according to the purposes of the processing`

-- 4(10): Art 4(10) the body is a third party
@export Under Article 4(10), as a controller, is the body a third party?
GIVEN body IS A `Kind of person or body` @desc Body: choose exactly one of: natural person; legal person; public authority; agency; other body; not a person or body.
      `the body is the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the body is the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the body is the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the body is the controller? Answer true or false.
      `the body is the processor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the body is the processor? Answer true or false.
      `the body is a person who, under the direct authority of the controller or processor, is authorised to process personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the body is a person who, under the direct authority of the controller or processor, is authorised to process personal data? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(10), as a controller, is the body a third party` IS
    `Art 4(10) the body is a third party` body `the body is the data subject` `the body is the controller` `the body is the processor` `the body is a person who, under the direct authority of the controller or processor, is authorised to process personal data`

-- 4(11): Art 4(11) the indication is the consent of the data subject
@export Under Article 4(11), as a controller, is what the data subject gave me consent?
GIVEN `the indication is freely given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the indication is freely given? Answer true or false.
      `the indication is specific` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the indication is specific? Answer true or false.
      `the indication is informed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the indication is informed? Answer true or false.
      `the indication is unambiguous` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the indication is unambiguous? Answer true or false.
      `the indication is of the data subject's wishes` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the indication is of the data subject's wishes? Answer true or false.
      `how the data subject signifies agreement` IS A `Art 4(11) how the data subject signifies agreement` @desc How the data subject signifies agreement: choose exactly one of: Art 4(11) by a statement; Art 4(11) by a clear affirmative action; Art 4(11) in some other way, with no statement and no clear affirmative action.
      `the agreement is to the processing of personal data relating to the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the agreement is to the processing of personal data relating to the data subject? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(11), as a controller, is what the data subject gave me consent` IS
    `Art 4(11) the indication is the consent of the data subject` `the indication is freely given` `the indication is specific` `the indication is informed` `the indication is unambiguous` `the indication is of the data subject's wishes` `how the data subject signifies agreement` `the agreement is to the processing of personal data relating to the data subject`

-- 4(12): Art 4(12) the incident is a personal data breach
@export Under Article 4(12), as a controller, is the incident a personal data breach?
GIVEN `there is a breach of security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that there is a breach of security? Answer true or false.
      `what the breach of security leads to` IS A `Art 4(12) consequence of a breach of security` @desc What the breach of security leads to: choose exactly one of: Art 4(12) accidental destruction of personal data; Art 4(12) unlawful destruction of personal data; Art 4(12) accidental loss of personal data; Art 4(12) unlawful loss of personal data; Art 4(12) accidental alteration of personal data; Art 4(12) unlawful alteration of personal data; Art 4(12) unauthorised disclosure of personal data; Art 4(12) unauthorised access to personal data; Art 4(12) some other consequence.
      `the personal data are transmitted, stored or otherwise processed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data are transmitted, stored or otherwise processed? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(12), as a controller, is the incident a personal data breach` IS
    `Art 4(12) the incident is a personal data breach` `there is a breach of security` (LIST `what the breach of security leads to`) `the personal data are transmitted, stored or otherwise processed`

-- 4(13): Art 4(13) the data are genetic data
@export Under Article 4(13), as a controller, are the data genetic data?
GIVEN `the data are personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the data relate to the inherited or acquired genetic characteristics of a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data relate to the inherited or acquired genetic characteristics of a natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data give unique information about the physiology or the health of that natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data give unique information about the physiology or the health of that natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data result from an analysis of a biological sample from the natural person in question` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data result from an analysis of a biological sample from the natural person in question? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(13), as a controller, are the data genetic data` IS
    `Art 4(13) the data are genetic data` `the data are personal data` `the data relate to the inherited or acquired genetic characteristics of a natural person` `the data give unique information about the physiology or the health of that natural person` `the data result from an analysis of a biological sample from the natural person in question`

-- 4(14): Art 4(14) the data are biometric data
@export Under Article 4(14), as a controller, are the data biometric data?
GIVEN `the data are personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the data result from specific technical processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data result from specific technical processing? Answer true or false.
      `the data relate to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data relate to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data allow or confirm the unique identification of that natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data allow or confirm the unique identification of that natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data are facial images or dactyloscopic data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are facial images or dactyloscopic data? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(14), as a controller, are the data biometric data` IS
    `Art 4(14) the data are biometric data` `the data are personal data` `the data result from specific technical processing` `the data relate to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a natural person` `the data allow or confirm the unique identification of that natural person` `the data are facial images or dactyloscopic data`

-- 4(15): Art 4(15) the data are data concerning health
@export Under Article 4(15), as a controller, are the data data concerning health?
GIVEN `the data are personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are personal data? Answer true or false.
      `the data relate to the physical or mental health of a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data relate to the physical or mental health of a natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data relate to the provision of health care services to the natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data relate to the provision of health care services to the natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data reveal information about the health status of the natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data reveal information about the health status of the natural person? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4(15), as a controller, are the data data concerning health` IS
    `Art 4(15) the data are data concerning health` `the data are personal data` `the data relate to the physical or mental health of a natural person` `the data relate to the provision of health care services to the natural person` `the data reveal information about the health status of the natural person`

-- 4(13-15): Art 4(13) to (15) the category of Article 9(1) that the data fall in by these definitions
@export Under Article 4(13) to (15), as a controller, which category of Article 9(1) do the data fall in by the definitions of genetic data, biometric data and data concerning health?
GIVEN `the data are genetic data` IS A `K2 controller answer` @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are genetic data? Answer K2 controller answer: yes, K2 controller answer: no or K2 controller answer: not sure (not sure is treated as not covered).
      `the data are biometric data` IS A `K2 controller answer` @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are biometric data? Answer K2 controller answer: yes, K2 controller answer: no or K2 controller answer: not sure (not sure is treated as not covered).
      `the biometric data are processed for the purpose of uniquely identifying a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the biometric data are processed for the purpose of uniquely identifying a natural person? Answer true or false.
      `the data are data concerning health` IS A `K2 controller answer` @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are data concerning health? Answer K2 controller answer: yes, K2 controller answer: no or K2 controller answer: not sure (not sure is treated as not covered).
GIVETH A MAYBE `Art 9(1) category of personal data`
DECIDE `Under Article 4(13) to (15), as a controller, which category of Article 9(1) do the data fall in by the definitions of genetic data, biometric data and data concerning health` IS
    `Art 4(13) to (15) the category of Article 9(1) that the data fall in by these definitions` (`K2 controller answer as a yes or no` `the data are genetic data`) (`K2 controller answer as a yes or no` `the data are biometric data`) `the biometric data are processed for the purpose of uniquely identifying a natural person` (`K2 controller answer as a yes or no` `the data are data concerning health`)

